WEBVTT

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:25.440
There she is now.

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.320
Welcome home!

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.990
I wonder what's wrong. Hina?
That's you, right?

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:40.790
Hina?

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.540
Rei...

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:50.920
Sis...

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:53.680
Hina!

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:44.040
Ladybug Bush (Part 2)

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.040
<i>These were the circumstances.</i>

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:54.300
<i>There was bullying going on in Hina's class.</i>

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:59.430
<i>It began suddenly in April,
when the now third-year classes switched,</i>

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:05.390
<i>splitting up into groups
based on names in alphabetical order.</i>

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:12.270
I. Told. You. Stop following us around.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:14.070
You're such a pest.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:15.900
Wh-Why?

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:21.410
<i>The victim was scared...</i>

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.200
<i>...and bewildered.</i>

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:32.540
<i>It started a vicious circle.</i>

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:38.920
<i>The girl's name was Chiho.</i>

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:46.100
<i>She and Hina were classmates
since elementary school</i>

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:48.100
<i>and always gotten along well.</i>

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:55.360
<i>Chiho was a really cute, kind,
and quiet girl who always smiled.</i>

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.940
<i>The third year began,
and entrance exams were looming.</i>

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.740
<i>When everyone was in the grip
of a nameless anxiety,</i>

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:06.370
<i>they said she was flirting with boys,</i>

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:08.870
<i>or acting like a goody-goody
in front of the teacher.</i>

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:12.080
<i>For vague reasons like these,</i>

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:15.750
<i>they began to ostracize her from their group.</i>

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:21.880
<i>Chiho recoiled and in response,
the girls in the group shunned her even more.</i>

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:28.810
<i>Everyone else was afraid of that group
and just looked on from a distance,</i>

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:32.560
<i>but of course,
Hina couldn't do something like that.</i>

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:38.070
<i>She was too fond of this girl who
she was friends with since elementary school.</i>

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:52.580
Why are you cleaning all by yourself?

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:53.920
Where are the others?

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:57.420
Um, they said they had things to do...

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:04.590
These are the pajamas we have to do
for home economics.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:07.890
Why are you bringing home
everyone else's, Chiho?

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.390
For six people?

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:12.770
I-It's not what you think.
I volunteered to do it.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:17.480
Let's talk to the teacher about this.

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:19.650
It can't go on like this.

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:21.740
No, don't tell the teacher!

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:25.450
If everyone found out,
they would bully me even more!

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:28.120
Hina, please! Don't tell anyone.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:58.150
<i>But little by little, the situation escalated.</i>

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:00.150
One shoe is missing...

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.530
My bag too...

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:05.740
The other shoe was dropped in the toilet.

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:15.790
<i>Chiho had a lot of absences
from school after that.</i>

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:21.670
I think you're misreading it, Ms. Kawamoto.

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:24.050
The girls in that group
are just playing harmless pranks.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:28.300
You shouldn't turn
every situation into a bad one.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.930
I thought you were
a more positive girl, Ms. Kawamoto.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:36.180
<i>Her teacher, too.</i>

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:40.400
Hina, you shouldn't get involved with Sakura.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.690
They might target you next.

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:45.650
<i>And her classmates, too.</i>

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:48.150
- Huh?
- Us?

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:49.910
Sorry.

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:54.040
I've had my hands full
preparing for entrance exams this year.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.580
<i>They all pretended
that they didn't see anything.</i>

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:03.040
<i>And then, finally...</i>

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:07.800
This is sudden, but Ms. Sakura is moving
to another school due to family circumstances.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:19.390
Chiho!

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:20.690
Hina!

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:25.610
<i>She'd stopped going to school,</i>

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:30.950
<i>so her mother decided they would move
to Iwate, where Chiho's father was working.</i>

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:33.410
I'm sorry, Hina.

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:35.660
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:39.540
After everything you've done for me...

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:00.230
Huh?

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:02.730
B Group is short one person.
Where's Sakura?

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:06.690
Teacher, Sakura changed schools.

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:10.070
What? This late in the year?
And so suddenly.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:14.820
I know. I hear they suddenly decided to move.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:18.790
I mean, really, who would go that far?

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:25.460
<i>I'm sorry. Hina, I'm sorry.</i>

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:36.890
Kawamoto!
Knock it off, Kawamoto!

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:02.040
<i>And so...</i>

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.250
<i>they next set their sights...</i>

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:08.800
<i>on Hina.</i>

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:12.720
Hina.

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:18.430
Sis, what should I have done?

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:25.440
Chiho was crying. She said she was afraid
to switch to another school.

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:31.440
She said, "What if I get bullied over there too?"
She was terrified!

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.950
Sis, I couldn't...

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:40.490
do anything to help Chiho!

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:42.950
Not one thing!

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:03.850
Sorry, Momo.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:06.350
I-I'm fine.

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:09.230
Sorry! I-I'm going for a run!

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:11.980
No, Hina! Don't go outside! It's dark!

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:14.320
- Don't go!
- I'll...

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:01.570
Hina!

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:07.960
Hina!

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:27.980
Why did this happen?

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:34.650
School was so fun to go to every day
until the second year.

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:41.660
Chiho was so stressed with everything,
so why did everyone...

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:48.910
pretend they didn't see anything or like,
"If you protect her, they'll target you next."

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:50.750
Why?

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:59.050
But things turned out
the way they said it would.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:02.300
From tomorrow, I'll be alone.

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:12.770
I'll be all alone...

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:14.190
I'm so scared!

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:19.780
The truth is, I've been scared this whole time.

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:24.410
But... But...

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:28.830
I don't regret anything at all! I can't!

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:30.120
Because...

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:35.960
...what I did was definitely not wrong!

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:47.350
<i>At that moment,
as I saw her declare that through sobs,</i>

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:52.230
<i>it felt like I was struck by lightning.</i>

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:08.200
<i>It's strange.</i>

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.040
<i>Even after...</i>

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:14.540
<i>so much time has passed,</i>

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:21.050
<i>something can save you,</i>

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:24.800
<i>coming in like a storm
from a completely different direction.</i>

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:31.730
Hina...

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:40.320
Thank you.

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:43.320
You are...

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.360
my lifesaver.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:48.830
I promise.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:51.750
I'll stay with you.

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:56.420
Rei...

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:03.720
Even if it takes the rest of my life,
I will pay you back.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:08.970
Ladybug Bush (Part 2)

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:12.970
Ladybug Bush (Part 3)

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:23.190
<i>The next day,</i>

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.280
<i>on the way back home from school,</i>

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:30.280
<i>Rei was sitting on a bench...</i>

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:33.870
<i>next to the bridge.</i>

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:39.420
<i>"There's something I want to research,
so I was hoping you can take me to the library."</i>

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:44.010
<i>That's what Rei said, so I led the way.</i>

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:18.120
<i>I hadn't been to the library
since elementary school.</i>

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:22.750
<i>When I saw the chairs in the kids' corner,</i>

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:33.680
<i>it made me think, "Were we that small?"</i>

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:36.180
<i>and tears came to my eyes.</i>

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:46.940
Book of Manju
Easy Sweets
Basics of Traditional Sweets

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:48.110
<i>"They had all of these."</i>

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:56.620
<i>As Rei said that, he brought over
several books of beautiful sweets.</i>

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:56.950
Traditional Sweets
Recommended Japanese-style Sweets

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:03.210
<i>I'd seen some of the sweets before
at Grandpa's shop.</i>

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:08.210
<i>There were also many pretty sweets
I never even knew about.</i>

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:16.970
<i>Rei sat next to me,
gazing at field guides on plants and insects.</i>

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:19.680
There it is.

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:22.440
I see.

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:25.440
It was called a "silverthorn."

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:29.610
And what I've always called
a two-starred ladybug is actually named

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:32.780
"Harmonia axyridis."

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:39.870
The characters for ladybug
are "Heavenly Path Insect"?

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.120
I wonder why.

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:44.000
<i>When I muttered that...</i>

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:55.760
Hold out your hand.

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:04.230
That tickles.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:05.900
It keeps climbing.

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:09.650
It took off!

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:16.410
<i>As we watched the ladybug fly away,
Rei explained to me...</i>

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:25.290
<i>that the Japanese name is from long ago,
when people pointed at this cute little creature,</i>

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:31.840
<i>as it flew towards the sun.</i>

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:36.680
<i>That's how it got its name.</i>

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:42.890
Ladybug Bush (Part 3)

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:46.900
Feelings

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:54.900
<i>While she gripped my sleeve and cried,</i>

00:17:55.660 --> 00:18:00.160
<i>my whole body throbbed
as if it had become one heart,</i>

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:03.750
<i>and it was so painful that it felt like
it wanted to tear me apart.</i>

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:10.750
<i>In that moment, I wanted to hunt down
the people who made her cry</i>

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.050
<i>and rip them limb from limb,</i>

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:16.550
<i>but that wouldn't solve the problem.</i>

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:19.550
<i>That wouldn't benefit her at all.</i>

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:23.060
<i>So think. Think.</i>

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:25.560
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:29.770
<i>Think!</i>

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:36.320
<i>Then, when we got back to her house...</i>

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:44.450
Welcome home.

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:47.330
I just finished making dinner.

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:50.590
Hina, Rei, welcome home!

00:18:57.510 --> 00:19:01.350
You went to the library?
With Rei? That's great.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:04.100
Rei, come on in as well, okay?

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:10.110
<i>It was Akari and Momo, the same as usual,</i>

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:15.240
<i>a warm dinner served on a low dining table,</i>

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:19.820
<i>and a grim-looking Grandpa, waiting for her.</i>

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:22.990
Hey. Hina, sit down.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.630
Akari told me everything.

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:38.430
PAW PAW

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:41.010
Hina...

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:44.760
You did good!

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:50.150
Grandpa?

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:57.400
Even I know how nasty bullying is after seeing it
in newspapers and on the news.

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:54.900
When Bullied Students Speak Up

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:55.900
"They put junk in my food."
Girl changes schools after bullying

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:57.400
Bullying Countermeasures Commission

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:01.530
Every time I see it in the news,
it breaks me up.

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:08.790
And yet you tried to help your friend
out of a scary situation like that!

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:12.170
That took real courage!

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:15.300
Not many adults could've done that!

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:16.800
You're amazing!

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:20.220
I'm proud of you, granddaughter!

00:20:20.470 --> 00:20:23.430
You didn't do a single thing wrong!

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:29.180
You helped your friend!

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:30.940
Be proud of yourself!

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:37.150
Grandpa.

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:44.120
I will.

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:01.990
<i>After that, we all had dinner.</i>

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:08.320
<i>Grandpa told me,
"Thanks for going after Hina last night."</i>

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:11.580
<i>"Now eat up,"
and he slapped me on the back.</i>

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:15.580
<i>Hina ate a lot too,
though she was crying the whole time.</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.170
<i>We had deep-fried chicken,
potato salad, and cream stew.</i>

00:22:22.050 --> 00:22:26.930
<i>Akari made all the food that Hina loves.</i>

00:22:46.070 --> 00:22:53.540
<i>As I chewed, I continuously searched my brain
for something I could do.</i>

00:22:57.040 --> 00:23:00.040
Feelings

00:24:30.010 --> 00:24:32.010
Next Episode Preview

00:24:32.010 --> 00:24:36.930
Episode 27

00:24:32.340 --> 00:24:36.930
You can take your time on this,
so listen patiently to their thoughts.

00:24:36.930 --> 00:24:40.940
You must honorably repay gratitude.
That is the way of things for humanity.

00:24:40.940 --> 00:24:43.360
You're finally willing to do it!

00:24:43.360 --> 00:24:44.860
I'm happy for you, Nikaidou!

00:24:44.860 --> 00:24:47.780
I mean, I'm a guy after all, so...

00:24:47.780 --> 00:24:50.030
I'm really no good, huh?

00:24:50.030 --> 00:24:58.330
ILLUSTRATOR:
TSUNAMI UMINO

00:24:51.030 --> 00:24:52.990
I'm hungry-meow.

00:24:52.990 --> 00:24:55.200
I want some fried chicken-meow.

00:24:55.200 --> 00:24:57.910
Potato salad is good too-meow.
